/**
 * @title IDiamondCut
 *
 * @notice Manages Diamond Facets.
 *
 * Reference Implementation  : https://github.com/mudgen/diamond-2-hardhat
 * EIP-2535 Diamond Standard : https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-2535
